},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"北京"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未上榜"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"—"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915200940-mzw4cv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915200940-mzw4cv7","updated":"20260915204423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A区（考研一区，共21个省/市）中，表中尚未出现的有4个："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"河北、山西、江西、河南"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。表中学校已覆盖北京、天津、辽宁、吉林、黑龙江、上海、江苏、浙江、安徽、福建、山东、湖北、湖南、广东、重庆、四川、陕西共17个省（市），另甘肃属B区。"}]},{"ID":"20260915205252-xez2zd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915205252-xez2zd2","updated":"20260915205252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若再把表中已高亮的14所学校（华南理工大学、中山大学、东北大学、华东师范大学、湖南大学、国防科技大学、中国人民大学、中国农业大学、吉林大学、兰州大学、西北农林科技大学、北京师范大学、中国海洋大学、中央民族大学）也去掉，A区未出现的省份不减反增，新少了2个："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"广东"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（华南理工大学、中山大学同时被去掉）、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"吉林"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（吉林大学被去掉）。此时A区未出现的省份共6个：河北、山西、江西、河南、广东、吉林。（甘肃也因兰州大学被去掉而没有学校代表，但属B区。）"}]},{"ID":"20260915205920-jl5oc4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915205920-jl5oc4d","updated":"20260915205920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统计口径：只取表中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"未被高亮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的26所学校，统计其"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"异地研究院/研究生院/校区"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所在城市（校本部所在城市不计，同一城市多个机构只计1次），数据来自各校官网及公开报道，其中北大（27个）、清华（16个）、华中科大（14个）等校异地机构较多，可能仍有遗漏。"}]},{"ID":"20260915205920-hygiqsh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260915205920-hygiqsh","updated":"20260915205920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHea